# CI local preflight

Before `gh pr create` / claiming CI-ready: run the same changed gates CI uses.
Vitest alone is not enough. Prefer
`CI_BASE_SHA=<merge-base> node scripts/ci-{format,typecheck,test,build}-changed.mjs`.
Do **not** default to full `pnpm -r build`.

Source of truth: [`docs/operations/ci-local-preflight.md`](../../docs/operations/ci-local-preflight.md)
